<!-- Summary / CTA -->
<mj-text padding="0px 12px 10px 12px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">Adamantium AI, a Dubai-based AI consultancy specializing in intelligent automation and AI-powered workflows, is looking for an <strong>AI Engineer / Automation Engineer</strong>. The role focuses on designing and deploying practical AI systems for client businesses, including chatbots, workflow automation, sales automation tools, and <strong>AI integrations with CRMs</strong> and marketing platforms. Candidates should have experience with Python or JavaScript, API integrations, prompt engineering, and automation tools such as<strong> Zapier, Make, or n8n</strong>. Experience with <strong>LangChain, RAG systems</strong>, vector databases, or production AI deployments is a plus.</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;"><a href="https://dubai.dubizzle.com/jobs/engineering/software-engineering/2026/3/3/ai-engineer-%5B%E2%80%A6%5Dngineer-full-time-2-023---27b71288546e485da1124d248cd01958/" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #102341; color: black;"><strong>Register here  </strong></a></p>
</mj-text>
