        <mj-text padding="10px 12px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
          <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">In the Mirbah area of Fujairah, an Emirati man <a href="https://gulfnews.com/uae/ramadan/how-an-emirati-man-in-fujairah-is-feeding-hundreds-during-ramadan-1.500460612" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #102341; color: black;">feeds hundreds</a> daily during Ramadan. Ali Al Kaabi prepares and distributes traditional Harees and other iftar dishes from after Dhuhr until Maghrib, turning a personal act of charity into a powerful symbol of community unity and Emirati heritage.</p>
        </mj-text>
